{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Cleaning Up", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li>  <li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>.</li>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I will help you with that. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Going to </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's going to take a while to clean it all up. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm picking up the trays after that. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">  Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"My interview is tomorrow at 10.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Respond Politely to Suggestions and Offers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely.<br><br>Remember to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions:<br>  <ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li> <li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li> <li>You should \u2026</li> <li>You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Would you like\u2026?</li><li>Can I get you \u2026 ?</li><li>Would you mind \u2026 ?</li><li>Why don't ...</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li> <li>I guess that could ...</li> <li>That would be \u2026</li> <li>I would \u2026</li> <li>I think I'd rather ...</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Why don't you start with the kitchen?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>:  I think I'd rather stick to the living room.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "jar ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a wide-mouthed cylindrical container made of glass ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I want to buy a jar of pickles.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tin ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a metal container ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to get a couple of tins of capers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " gallon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a measuring unit for liquids equal to four quarts (3.5 liters) ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's buy a gallon of orange juice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "tray ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large serving dish ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll prepare a tray of hors d'oeuvres.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "leftovers ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " food left after a meal ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The best part is that you'll have leftovers for days!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "exhausting ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tiring ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Playing gigs all the time sounds exhausting!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gravy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sauce made from the fat and juices you get from meat after cooking", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: The gravy is not ready yet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (12-14 lines) about your plans for the next holidays.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, think of 5 or 6 things to do. Make sure you include: <ul> <li>quantities and amounts</li> <li>actions in the future</li> </ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make suggestions and talk about preferences. Express your disagreement about the activities and respond politely.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find one suggestion that you both agree on.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I make suggestions and respond to offers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue and read it aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what I plan to do in the future.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le16ob11re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob11re2img06.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This party was great! Everyone had so much fun. The best part is that we have all this food left.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Look at the state of the dining room! It's a mess. There are plates and glasses everywhere. It's going to take a while to clean it all up.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Don't worry, V. I will help you with that."}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob11re2img01.jpg", "time": "16150", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh thanks, Sally. You're the best. Why don't you start with the kitchen?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think I'd rather stick to the living room. I don't want to mess with your utensils! Besides, there is plenty to do around here, don't you think?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Alright. You should start by collecting all the empty jars and tins.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure. I'm picking up the trays after that. We'll put the leftovers in the fridge."}, {"image": "engenn6le16ob11re2img06.jpg", "time": "36250", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure there is space in there. There are a couple of gallons of juice and a quart of gravy. Honestly, having parties at home is exhausting.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, we should get started then! I think we deserve a good night's sleep too. Besides, my interview with Luther is tomorrow at 10 ..."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le16ob11re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about quantities and amounts. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can respond politely to suggestions and offers. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future actions, plans and intentions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you clean up your place? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you like to keep your place clean? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How much stuff do you have in your place? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"cont